== Effect ==
* Spawns a {{E|Charger}} [[familiar]] that charges across the [[room]] when Isaac shoots, dealing [[damage]] to any enemies in its path until it hits an [[obstacle]] or wall.
** {{dlc|na}} Little Chubby is fired directly from where Isaac is standing.
** {{dlc|a}} Little Chubby is fired directly from where it is located in the chain of familiars behind Isaac.
** The familiar deals 3.5 damage per tick.
*** {{dlc|nr}} Deals 52.5 damage per second.
*** {{dlc|r}} Deals 105 damage per second.
** The familiar's attack is affected by momentum, just as tears are. Thus, it can be shot diagonally.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r+}} This item has a 1% chance to drop when defeating {{e|Chub}}.{{dlc-}}
* For Little Chubby to recharge, it must first get back to Isaac. Therefore, running away from Little Chubby after firing it will extend the time required to recharge it.
* The enemy {{E|Chubber}} can attack like this item, but they have limited range.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars, with Little Chubby having {{dlc|nr+}} 5th / {{dlc|r+}} 7th priority.

== Interactions ==
* {{t|Duct Tape}}: Familiar will stay in place relative to Isaac, however, it will still charge across the room but will always return to the spot it first returned to after charging across a room.
* {{I|Marked|r}}: Little Chubby will charge at the direction that is marked on the floor.

